    "Worker original and independent future calculations remain duplicated.",
    "Follow late packets retain independent complete point reproof.",
    "Broad independent domains can lose curved/high-speed world coverage; complete current proof still required if unavailable.",
    "R56unknown off-CPU interval not attributed; bounded phase observation only.",
    "Standarddev2-r57 and all M4-M6 still required."
